#: ../../tools/ncbi_datasets_tools.rst:32 1669b46ebac542bb92169d06d8ababfb
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get comprehensive gene information from NCBI by Gene ID."
" Returns gene symbol, description, chromosomal location, genomic "
"coordinates, cross-references to UniProt/Ensembl/OMIM, synonyms, and "
"annotation details. Covers all organisms in NCBI Gene database. Example: "
"gene\\_id 7157 returns TP53 (tumor protein p53) on chromosome 17."
msgstr ""

