#: ../../tools/ncbi_datasets_tools.rst:97 1d67bec6132b42b4a85385b35840a17b
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get orthologous genes across species for a given NCBI "
"Gene ID. Returns orthologs identified by NCBI's Ortholog pipeline, "
"including gene symbols, species, and gene types for each ortholog. Useful"
" for comparative genomics and cross-species gene function studies. "
"Example: gene\\_id 7157 (TP53) returns mouse Trp53, rat Tp53, zebrafish "
"tp53, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ncbi_datasets_tools.rst:101 6566497d32704bf79e9dd9a222e6a95a
msgid ""
"``gene_id`` (string) (required) NCBI Gene ID (numeric). Examples: '7157' "
"(TP53), '672' (BRCA1), '3630' (INS)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ncbi_datasets_tools.rst:104 e279924356394826af234245e31bb005
msgid ""
"``page_size`` (integer) (optional) Maximum number of orthologs to return "
"(1-100). Default: 20."
msgstr ""

