#: ../../tools/ncbi_datasets_tools.rst:162 31ab842c974c4d8b91070fcaba54585d
msgid ""
"**Description**: Suggest taxonomic names matching a query string. "
"Searches NCBI Taxonomy for organisms by partial name, returning matching "
"scientific names, taxonomy IDs, common names, and ranks. Useful for "
"finding taxonomy IDs from partial organism names. Example: 'drosophila' "
"returns D. melanogaster (7227), D. simulans (7240), etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ncbi_datasets_tools.rst:166 af954f872be84031b610793fe77f8584
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Partial organism name to search. Examples: "
"'drosophila', 'escherichia', 'arabidopsis', 'saccharomyces'."
